<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="12">
    <title>Техническое обслуживание — __APP_NAME__</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-gradient: linear-gradient(135deg, #faf8f5 0%, #f4eee6 50%, #f0ede6 100%);
            --card-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
            --card-border: rgba(230, 222, 214, 0.9);
            --primary: #5c7f67;
            --primary-light: #eaf1ec;
            --text-main: #2d3748;
            --text-muted: #718096;
            --accent: #d97706;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-gradient);
            color: var(--text-main);
            min-height: 100vh;
            min-height: 100dvh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 520px;
            width: 100%;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 2.75rem 2rem;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -15px rgba(92, 127, 103, 0.12),
                        0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .icon-wrapper {
            width: 88px;
            height: 88px;
            margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--primary-light);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--primary);
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(92, 127, 103, 0.15);
            animation: pulse-ring 3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulse-ring {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: scale(1);
            }
            50% {
                transform: scale(1.05);
            }
        }

        .icon-wrapper svg {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            background: #fef3c7;
            color: #92400e;
            font-size: 0.8125rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .badge-dot {
            width: 8px;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: #d97706;
            animation: blink 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.3; }
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.625rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1a202c;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            letter-spacing: -0.015em;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 0.975rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .progress-box {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            color: #4a5568;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
        }

        .progress-label {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .progress-spinner {
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            border: 2px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-top-color: var(--primary);
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: spin 0.8s linear infinite;
        }

        @keyframes spin {
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .brand-footer {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-size: 0.8125rem;
            color: #a0aec0;
            border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
            padding-top: 1.25rem;
        }

        .brand-footer strong {
            color: #718096;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="icon-wrapper">
            <!-- Sparkles & Gift Craft Icon -->
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 12v10H4V12"/>
                <path d="M2 7h20v5H2z"/>
                <path d="M12 22V7"/>
                <path d="M12 7H7.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5C11 2 12 7 12 7z"/>
                <path d="M12 7h4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 0-5C13 2 12 7 12 7z"/>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <div class="badge">
            <span class="badge-dot"></span>
            Обновление системы
        </div>

        <h1>Скоро вернёмся онлайн!</h1>
        <p>
            Мы обновляем каталог и улучшаем магазин авторских подарков <strong>__APP_NAME__</strong>. 
            Это займёт буквально пару минут.
        </p>

        <div class="progress-box">
            <div class="progress-label">
                <div class="progress-spinner"></div>
                <span>Идёт применение обновления...</span>
            </div>
            <span id="countdown">12 сек</span>
        </div>

        <div class="brand-footer">
            <span>© __APP_NAME__</span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>Авторские подарки и милые вещи</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Automatic countdown display before meta-refresh triggers
        var count = 12;
        var countdownEl = document.getElementById('countdown');
        if (countdownEl) {
            var interval = setInterval(function() {
                count--;
                if (count <= 0) {
                    countdownEl.textContent = 'Обновляем...';
                    clearInterval(interval);
                    window.location.reload();
                } else {
                    countdownEl.textContent = count + ' сек';
                }
            }, 1000);
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
